WEBVTT

00:00:01.186 --> 00:00:06.056
Yume kara samete mo
Even if I wake from my dreams

00:00:07.086 --> 00:00:12.546
Kono te wo nobasu yo
I'll reach my hand out to you

00:00:24.076 --> 00:00:29.336
Onaji tsuyosa de yobi au
If our hearts can reach each other

00:00:30.076 --> 00:00:34.706
Kokoro ni nareru no naraba
with the same strength

00:00:35.946 --> 00:00:41.216
Nanninbun no kizu demo
Then I would be able to bare

00:00:41.756 --> 00:00:46.886
Boku wa uketome rareru yo
The pain of many hearts

00:00:47.296 --> 00:00:50.886
Mousukoshi datte kiga surun da
I can feel that it will arrive soon

00:00:50.966 --> 00:00:55.836
Kono kabe ga kuzureru
When these walls will be torn down

00:00:56.636 --> 00:01:01.036
Reimei
The dawn

00:01:02.776 --> 00:01:08.736
Yume kara samete mo
mada minai yume no houmade
Even if we wake from our dreams
We'll have to keep running

00:01:08.816 --> 00:01:14.726
Bokura wa hitori de
hashiri tuzukeru shika nain da
Towards our unrevealed dreams

00:01:14.786 --> 00:01:21.356
Korogari mayotte tsukuri dasu
boku no inryoku ga
The gravity by my painful journey
will draw me

00:01:21.626 --> 00:01:27.566
Itsuka kimi e
To you one day

00:01:31.936 --> 00:01:33.206
What's this about?

00:01:34.006 --> 00:01:34.806
I wonder...

00:01:35.306 --> 00:01:37.246
What do you mean, "I wonder..."?

00:01:37.816 --> 00:01:39.876
We don't even know the source.

00:01:40.446 --> 00:01:43.646
It's like speculations are breeding
more speculations now.

00:01:44.356 --> 00:01:47.086
Doesn't that happen a lot
on the forum?

00:01:47.286 --> 00:01:48.156
Sure...

00:01:48.726 --> 00:01:49.516
But...

00:01:49.886 --> 00:01:50.326
Huh?

00:01:51.296 --> 00:01:55.196
It's a different story
if Ovan is involved.

00:01:56.566 --> 00:01:57.556
You're right.

00:01:58.266 --> 00:01:59.426
This situation...

00:02:00.306 --> 00:02:02.466
...cannot be overlooked by TaN.

00:02:03.266 --> 00:02:04.466
No, it can't.

00:02:07.946 --> 00:02:09.406
All right!

00:02:13.346 --> 00:02:16.506
The black Multi-Weapon, Haseo.

00:02:33.296 --> 00:02:35.466
One day you'll understand.

00:02:39.636 --> 00:02:41.506
Let's meet again soon.

00:02:48.146 --> 00:02:50.086
You can't quit.

00:02:54.886 --> 00:02:57.326
Don't say that...

00:02:59.756 --> 00:03:02.316
...because we need you.

00:03:12.906 --> 00:03:13.776
Ovan...

00:03:36.196 --> 00:03:38.956
Are you Haseo?

00:03:43.776 --> 00:03:44.466
And if I am?

00:03:58.256 --> 00:04:01.706
Are you just going to
leave it at that with Haseo?

00:04:03.256 --> 00:04:04.746
Hey, hey...

00:04:06.226 --> 00:04:07.026
Is it okay?

00:04:07.496 --> 00:04:08.156
Really?

00:04:12.036 --> 00:04:13.626
I'm talking to you!

00:04:14.636 --> 00:04:15.256
Ovan?

00:04:17.436 --> 00:04:18.836
Hey!

00:04:21.076 --> 00:04:24.706
When the time comes,
everything will fall into place.

00:04:26.876 --> 00:04:27.936
Haseo...

00:04:28.786 --> 00:04:31.046
We've only just planted the seed.

00:04:31.456 --> 00:04:33.216
It's too early to harvest.

00:04:34.486 --> 00:04:35.356
Haseo?

00:04:43.296 --> 00:04:44.696
I beg you!

00:04:45.266 --> 00:04:47.286
Please!
It's okay, right?

00:04:47.366 --> 00:04:48.566
I'm begging you!

00:04:48.936 --> 00:04:50.526
Uh, what the...?

00:04:50.606 --> 00:04:54.306
Aren't you the "Legendary
Black Multi-Weapon", Mr. Haseo?

00:04:55.706 --> 00:04:56.736
"Legendary"?

00:04:57.716 --> 00:04:59.376
You look like a First Form...

00:04:59.446 --> 00:05:01.746
...but you have the specs
of a Third Form!

00:05:01.816 --> 00:05:03.806
You're seriously cool!

00:05:03.886 --> 00:05:06.376
Please let us be in your party!

00:05:06.456 --> 00:05:11.046
If you're around there's
nothing for us to fear.

00:05:12.726 --> 00:05:14.456
Hey, wait!

00:05:29.306 --> 00:05:30.336
I found you!

00:05:31.276 --> 00:05:33.766
I never thought I'd meet you
in a place like this!

00:05:34.146 --> 00:05:36.746
Haseo, "The Enchanting
Black Multi-Weapon"!

00:05:38.986 --> 00:05:41.116
This time it's "enchanting"?

00:05:42.256 --> 00:05:43.186
For real?

00:05:43.326 --> 00:05:46.186
He really doesn't look
any different from a normal PC.

00:05:46.256 --> 00:05:48.856
Idiot. That's because
he's a secret character.

00:05:49.226 --> 00:05:50.196
I get it.

00:05:50.466 --> 00:05:51.056
What?

00:05:51.336 --> 00:05:52.626
Then...

00:05:52.696 --> 00:05:53.666
...let's get on with it!

00:05:58.306 --> 00:06:01.676
He's not giving up any
Chim Spheres or Rare Items.

00:06:01.776 --> 00:06:02.766
Are you...

00:06:02.846 --> 00:06:05.936
...really Haseo, "The Enchanting
Black Multi-Weapon"?

00:06:06.776 --> 00:06:08.546
I'm Tanaka.

00:06:09.016 --> 00:06:11.746
Quit telling such obvious lies!

00:06:11.886 --> 00:06:13.746
Well, nothing here.

00:06:14.756 --> 00:06:16.116
Nothing much on him.

00:06:16.556 --> 00:06:18.586
It doesn't matter what it is,
just give us anything!

00:06:29.466 --> 00:06:31.196
You're Haseo, right?

00:06:36.576 --> 00:06:39.306
Haven't you been
reading the forum?

00:06:39.776 --> 00:06:40.246
Huh?

00:06:40.746 --> 00:06:43.146
Everybody's talking about you.

00:06:43.516 --> 00:06:46.246
The Legendary
Black Multi-Weapon...

00:06:46.316 --> 00:06:48.546
The Enchanting
Black Multi-Weapon...

00:06:48.856 --> 00:06:50.556
The modified rare character.

00:06:51.556 --> 00:06:55.086
An Al character whose player
doesn't exist in the real world.

00:06:55.326 --> 00:06:56.156
And...

00:06:56.226 --> 00:06:57.126
And you?

00:06:58.396 --> 00:06:59.726
What do you think I am?

00:07:00.606 --> 00:07:01.196
I don't know.

00:07:03.036 --> 00:07:08.306
Your identity is not
what's important to me.

00:07:09.406 --> 00:07:13.406
What I'm interested in
is your connection to Ovan.

00:07:14.586 --> 00:07:15.276
I suppose.

00:07:17.516 --> 00:07:23.316
This whole ruckus on the forum
came from Ovan himself.

00:07:23.656 --> 00:07:25.246
At least, that's my take.

00:07:26.096 --> 00:07:26.786
Ovan?

00:07:27.366 --> 00:07:28.126
Why?

00:07:28.196 --> 00:07:31.286
I mean, do you know Ovan?

00:07:33.696 --> 00:07:35.066
Give and take.

00:07:35.866 --> 00:07:37.496
It's the principle of business.

00:07:41.046 --> 00:07:44.536
If you give me
all the information you have...

00:07:44.616 --> 00:07:47.206
...I'll give you what I have.

00:07:48.086 --> 00:07:48.706
How about it?

00:07:51.356 --> 00:07:54.716
As far as I know, Ovan is-

00:07:54.856 --> 00:07:55.876
By the way...

00:07:56.126 --> 00:07:56.556
Huh?

00:07:57.496 --> 00:07:58.756
By the way...

00:07:58.826 --> 00:08:02.526
...I don't want to hear about
the eccentric man looking for...

00:08:02.596 --> 00:08:05.356
...the Key of the Twilight,
or the Master of the Twilight Brigade.

00:08:05.496 --> 00:08:07.486
That's common knowledge.

00:08:08.666 --> 00:08:09.726
What's wrong?

00:08:10.366 --> 00:08:11.306
Go on.

00:08:12.036 --> 00:08:14.006
I don't know anything else.

00:08:14.806 --> 00:08:15.536
What?!

00:08:26.716 --> 00:08:28.846
Plants are mysterious things.

00:08:29.726 --> 00:08:32.386
Even if you forget
having planted the seed...

00:08:32.456 --> 00:08:34.856
...when the time comes,
it will naturally sprout.

00:08:35.766 --> 00:08:38.356
And that plant will in turn
spread its seeds and die.

00:08:41.636 --> 00:08:45.596
If you give it water,
light and fertilizer...

00:08:45.676 --> 00:08:47.166
...the greater the effect.

00:08:50.616 --> 00:08:53.076
What color flowers do you like,
Ovan?

00:08:55.016 --> 00:08:55.746
Black.

00:08:56.346 --> 00:09:00.516
Well, I'm pretty busy,
so I'm leaving now.

00:09:00.586 --> 00:09:01.286
Wait!

00:09:03.486 --> 00:09:04.586
I told you.

00:09:04.756 --> 00:09:06.696
Give and take.

00:09:06.856 --> 00:09:08.346
That's the principle of business.

00:09:10.396 --> 00:09:12.156
Well...

00:09:12.736 --> 00:09:14.726
First you need to get stronger.

00:09:16.566 --> 00:09:20.666
I'll give you credit for coming
back even though you were PK'd.

00:09:21.146 --> 00:09:21.766
What?!

00:09:24.716 --> 00:09:26.906
But you have to get stronger.

00:09:28.716 --> 00:09:29.236
Got it?

00:09:30.686 --> 00:09:31.616
You...

00:09:32.186 --> 00:09:35.276
Why do you know about me?

00:09:39.126 --> 00:09:40.496
Let's meet again!

00:09:42.896 --> 00:09:43.826
How did it go?

00:09:44.336 --> 00:09:46.196
Hard to say.

00:09:46.496 --> 00:09:47.366
Huh?

00:09:47.666 --> 00:09:50.066
What I don't understand is...

00:09:51.576 --> 00:09:53.936
...why is Ovan interested
in a kid like that?

00:09:55.006 --> 00:09:56.036
Beats me.

00:09:57.146 --> 00:10:00.706
Ovan has taken
an interest in Haseo...

00:10:00.846 --> 00:10:03.316
...so what we think of him
really doesn't matter.

00:10:04.086 --> 00:10:05.206
I guess so.

00:10:05.286 --> 00:10:08.726
As long as that remains true...

00:10:08.786 --> 00:10:10.846
...we have got to make our move.

00:10:11.526 --> 00:10:12.496
Exactly.

00:10:27.906 --> 00:10:28.666
Ovan...

00:10:29.576 --> 00:10:30.476
Haseo!

00:10:34.286 --> 00:10:35.616
Hi, Haseo!

00:10:36.746 --> 00:10:38.976
You must be that...

00:10:39.756 --> 00:10:43.016
That bright and eager beginner
who joined the Twilight Brigade.

00:10:44.196 --> 00:10:45.526
I'm Tabby!

00:10:47.996 --> 00:10:50.396
Uh, wait!

00:10:50.466 --> 00:10:51.396
Haseo!

00:10:51.466 --> 00:10:52.526
Haseo!

00:10:54.666 --> 00:10:56.366
Hey, Haseo!

00:10:57.476 --> 00:10:58.936
Haseo!

00:11:00.206 --> 00:11:01.106
Haseo!

00:11:02.606 --> 00:11:03.576
What?

00:11:05.946 --> 00:11:08.076
Ovan gave this to me.

00:11:09.316 --> 00:11:10.116
Ovan did?

00:11:12.016 --> 00:11:13.846
Uh, what is it?

00:11:14.786 --> 00:11:15.516
What?

00:11:15.686 --> 00:11:17.586
You don't know
what a guest key is?

00:11:18.196 --> 00:11:19.246
Well, excuse me.

00:11:19.556 --> 00:11:21.256
When are you going to join us?

00:11:22.226 --> 00:11:23.716
Join the Twilight Brigade?

00:11:24.096 --> 00:11:26.426
You're not part of a guild yet,
right?

00:11:28.206 --> 00:11:29.896
If you have the guest key...

00:11:29.966 --> 00:11:33.206
...you can enter the
Twilight Brigade's @home any time.

00:11:35.176 --> 00:11:36.806
Ovan's waiting for you.

00:11:38.116 --> 00:11:39.736
You're waiting too, right?

00:11:39.846 --> 00:11:40.316
Huh?

00:11:41.016 --> 00:11:42.606
To meet Ovan.

00:11:44.686 --> 00:11:45.416
Ovan...

00:11:46.186 --> 00:11:47.946
